{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">下周五是中秋節，維園即日起舉行綵燈會，免費入場。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">綵燈會一連11日舉行，傍晚近六時半舉行亮燈儀式，每晚開放到晚上11時，中秋節當晚延長至午夜12時。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.MIDAUTUMN-1930_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026pYLX5AzTDU1789652233.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.MIDAUTUMN-1930_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.MIDAUTUMN-1930_004.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20260rermEYQco1789652244.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.MIDAUTUMN-1930_004.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">同場有旅發局首度舉行的國際中秋綵燈匯，亮點是國家級非遺南京秦淮燈彩，以香港大榕樹為靈感創作、約八米高的大型綵燈「樹影流光」，以及世界綵燈大街，集合法國、德國、菲律賓等20個國家及地區，逾3,000盞特色綵燈。另外，康文署放置的綵燈，包括由資深紮作師傅製作的傳統花燈。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.MIDAUTUMN-1930_006.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20260guuDGboBi1789652254.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.MIDAUTUMN-1930_006.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.MIDAUTUMN-1930_007.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20267TYMK6BdFh1789652268.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.MIDAUTUMN-1930_007.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中秋節當天，港鐵不會通宵行駛，本地鐵路綫及輕鐵路綫會延長服務約一個半小時。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T13:59:41.957433+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":246,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}